  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n2513 - 20\n\n**__[(2 + 5 + 1 + 3)__** - 1] × 2 = 20\n\n__(11 - 1)__ × 2 = 20\n\n__**10**____** × 2**__ = 20\n\n20 = 20 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n4213 - 18\n\n__[(4 + 2 + 1 + 3)__ - 1] × 2 = 18\n\n__(10 - 1)__ × 2 = 18\n\n__9____ × 2__ = 18\n\n18 = 18 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 1462 - 26\n\n__[(1 + 4 + 6 + 2)__ - 1] × 2 = 26\n\n__(13 - 1)__ × 2 = 26\n\n__12____ × 2__ = 26\n\n24 ≠ 26 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 3122 - 14\n\n__[(3 + 1 + 2 + 2)__ - 1] × 2 = 14\n\n__(8 - 1)__ × 2 = 14\n\n__7____ × 2__ = 14\n\n14 = 14 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3) 2521 - 10 \n\n__[(2 + 5 + 2 + 1)__ - 1] × 2 = 10\n\n__(10 - 1)__ × 2 = 10\n\n__9____ × 2__ = 10\n\n18 ≠ 10 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) 5131 - 22\n\n__[(5 + 1 + 3 + 1)__ - 1] × 2 = 22\n\n__(10 - 1)__ × 2 = 22\n\n__9____ × 2__ = 22\n\n18 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options, '3122 - 14' follows the same logic as given.\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
